{
  "_read": [
    "THE PUBLIC SURFACE: every name an adopter builds on, as of this version. A project pins a version",
    "and writes these names into its deployment, its holdrim.json, its pages, its scripts and its proxy;",
    "renaming one breaks them, and nothing in this repository would notice.",
    "engine/tests/surface.test.js derives each list from the code and fails on any difference. When it",
    "fails on purpose, change this file AND the current section of CHANGELOG.md in the same change —",
    "under **Breaking**, with what to change, when a name was renamed or removed.",
    "`list-json` is a key path: `[]` is a list, `.` a nested object. `http-routes` is METHOD and path;",
    "`*` answers any method, `:param` is one path segment, and a trailing `/*` is a folder of files."
  ],
